ipped with higher-quality armor. Good at fighting underequipped enemy forces.","abilities":["Can only be blocked by units with at least 2 Block","Can use long-ranged weapons to attack <Ursus Civilians> and <Talulah, the Fighter>"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1.5,"stats":{"hp":10000,"atk":700,"def":500,"res":50,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2.2}},"enraged_possessed_leader":{"slug":"enraged_possessed_leader","name":"Enraged Possessed Leader","icon":"/enemies-icons/Enraged Possessed Leader.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Possessed","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"An enemy combatant who has completely given in to primal madness as their lifeforce is consumed. The infection has penetrated their bone marrow, and their death-defying aggression breaks the bounds of reason. The appearance of such an aberration on the battlefield is almost beyond imagination.","abilities":["Will gradually lose HP over time"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":true,"moveSpeed":1.2,"stats":{"hp":90000,"atk":1750,"def":230,"res":30,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":1.3}},"rosmontis_simulated_sentry_enemy_8007_eltrsm_2":{"slug":"rosmontis_simulated_sentry_enemy_8007_eltrsm_2","name":"Rosmontis, Simulated Sentry","icon":"/enemies-icons/Rosmontis, Simulated Sentry.webp","rank":"Boss","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee and Ranged","damageType":["Physical","Arts"],"flavourText":"A Breakthrough Trainer simulating Rosmontis at the peak of her combat prowess.\nAs she gazes at the 'walking arsenal' brought to life from data, her memories are finally liberated. Braver and more determined, she now yearns to fight alongside her companions.","abilities":["[Mind Matrix] Takes less Physical and Arts damage. Loses this effect when the V.T.E. on the field is destroyed and cannot attack until the V.T.E. is re-obtained.","First Form","[Fling] Hurls a <V.T.E.> at an allied unit regardless of distance, dealing 3 instances of Physical damage to the target when it lands (The second and third instances are aftershocks, dealing half damage). Stunned targets are instantly defeated.","[Retrieve] Clears all Matrices on the field and retrieves all Tactical Equipment.","[Impulse Inhibition] Initiates revival when HP reaches 0, periodically dealing Arts damage over a wide area around her every few seconds during the process.","Second Form","[Amplified Fling] Hurls a second <V.T.E.> a few seconds after the first. Stunned targets are instantly defeated.","[Memory Loss] Loses a certain amount of HP with every attack and deals Arts damage over a wide area around her."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.4,"stats":{"hp":40000,"atk":1600,"def":1000,"res":50,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":4}},"rosmontiss_drone":{"slug":"rosmontiss_drone","name":"Rosmontis's Drone","icon":"/enemies-icons/Rosmontis's Drone.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Flying","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A cutting-edge drone designed by Rhodes Island's Engineering Department specifically for this round of Vector Breakout training training.\nRosmontis loves its color.","abilities":["Flying unit.","Can only be attacked while inside a Matrix.","Attacks deal AoE damage.","After two attacks, the next attack stuns all targets.","When defeated, leaves behind Supplies that will activate when Rosmontis, Simulated Sentry triggers [Cognitive Collapse]. Upon activation, allied units in a wide area will take reduced Physical and Arts damage."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.4,"stats":{"hp":10000,"atk":700,"def":550,"res":40,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":5}}},"dropIcons":{"act1vecb_milestone_point":"/item-icons/a